  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.63 Medical director",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.63 “Medical director” means a medical resource hospital physician who has the oversight of the following:\n\n(a) Education;\n\n(b) Leadership;\n\n(c) Advice;\n\n(d) Critiques;\n\n(e) Performance improvement;\n\n(f) Medications; and\n\n(g) Treatment modalities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
